<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply higher in very heavy trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 60.01 to 5992.86, a record. For the week, the Dow rose 119.94 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 4.02 to 374.16, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose 43 cents.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1,765 to 709.</p>
<p>Volume was 463,882,290, compared with 386,123,580 Thursday. For the week, volume was 2,106,322,290.</p>
